    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most legendary empress in Chinese history and navigate the treacherous imperial court: forge alliances, crush enemies, tame powerful ministers, and even shatter the chains of convention to establish a magnificent empire that reflects your rule!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/550b5e10c85db4b7f7a73d99934e42a1.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/550b5e10c85db4b7f7a73d99934e42a1.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/cf0f7951a72c01dab1d3ae554f2b9dc9.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/cf0f7951a72c01dab1d3ae554f2b9dc9.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/00e345ed343ed247fe174d3813775c79.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/00e345ed343ed247fe174d3813775c79.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/998dcbb710740d4b9b590cbe141c2927.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/998dcbb710740d4b9b590cbe141c2927.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/5a060e04d52eca85eaca7df4e01191cb.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/5a060e04d52eca85eaca7df4e01191cb.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/f3e8c1a3a479efa1dba613d482b76462.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/f3e8c1a3a479efa1dba613d482b76462.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf MULTIPLE BRANCHING PATHS: GO SHAPE YOUR FATE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 100 divergent storylines, where your survival hinges on your choices. Amidst these life-or-death trials, your only tools are wit, bravery, and emotional acumen. Will they be enough to see you through to the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf BE THE PROTAGONIST: AN INTERACTIVE DRAMA OF POWER AND STRATEGY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cinematic world of ancient power struggles from a thousand years ago, where every decision shapes your fate. This interactive experience immerses you in court intrigue, making the battle for power feel real and relentless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE: 4K TANG DYNASTY THAT COMES TO LIFE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the splendor of ancient Chinese imperial courts in breathtaking 4K visuals, immersing yourself in the vibrant culture and artistic wonders of the East\u2014inviting you to explore a world where every detail echoes the grandeur of tradition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf TANG DYNASTY UNLEASHED: UNCOVER THE WILDEST SECRETS OF HISTORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within these palace walls, the strictest rules conceal the darkest desires\u2014from secret bonds between a prince and a male bard, to a princess and her hidden lover. Ghosts haunt the cold palace, while sparks fly between a female official and a handsome attendant... And you will be the one to unravel it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf TONS OF EASTER EGGS: EXCLUSIVE ACHIEVEMENTS AWAIT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden stories and truths as you navigate. Beyond the main story, countless secrets await. Delve into untold histories, discover how others truly perceive you\u2014who\u2019s genuine, and who\u2019s just acting? Who\u2019s being played, and who\u2019s the mastermind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf PERSONALITY REPORT: DISCOVER YOURSELF, CONNECT BETTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision you make shapes a unique version of you. At the end, you'll receive a personalized report. It\u2019s a chance to discover yourself and see how you connect with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf ELITE TEAM: DRIVEN BY PURPOSE, UNITED BY PASSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of The Invisible Guardian, a British Academy Film Awards-winning title, NEW ONE STUDIO brings its signature craftsmanship and storytelling expertise to this immersive interactive experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most legendary empress in Chinese history and navigate the treacherous imperial court: forge alliances, crush enemies, tame powerful ministers, and even shatter the chains of convention to establish a magnificent empire that reflects your rule!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/550b5e10c85db4b7f7a73d99934e42a1.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/550b5e10c85db4b7f7a73d99934e42a1.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/cf0f7951a72c01dab1d3ae554f2b9dc9.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/cf0f7951a72c01dab1d3ae554f2b9dc9.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/00e345ed343ed247fe174d3813775c79.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/00e345ed343ed247fe174d3813775c79.webp?t=1755624078\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=270 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478050/extras/998dcbb710740d4b9b590cbe141c2927.poster.webp?t=1755624078\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\