hinese imperial courts in breathtaking 4K visuals, immersing yourself in the vibrant culture and artistic wonders of the East\u2014inviting you to explore a world where every detail echoes the grandeur of tradition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf TANG DYNASTY UNLEASHED: UNCOVER THE WILDEST SECRETS OF HISTORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within these palace walls, the strictest rules conceal the darkest desires\u2014from secret bonds between a prince and a male bard, to a princess and her hidden lover. Ghosts haunt the cold palace, while sparks fly between a female official and a handsome attendant... And you will be the one to unravel it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf TONS OF EASTER EGGS: EXCLUSIVE ACHIEVEMENTS AWAIT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden stories and truths as you navigate. Beyond the main story, countless secrets await. Delve into untold histories, discover how others truly perceive you\u2014who\u2019s genuine, and who\u2019s just acting? Who\u2019s being played, and who\u2019s the mastermind?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf PERSONALITY REPORT: DISCOVER YOURSELF, CONNECT BETTER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each decision you make shapes a unique version of you. At the end, you'll receive a personalized report. It\u2019s a chance to discover yourself and see how you connect with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf ELITE TEAM: DRIVEN BY PURPOSE, UNITED BY PASSION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of The Invisible Guardian, a British Academy Film Awards-winning title, NEW ONE STUDIO brings its signature craftsmanship and storytelling expertise to this immersive interactive experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the shoes of China's most legendary empress and experience her extraordinary life in this high-risk, full-motion video journey. Navigate desire, darkness, schemes, betrayal, and redemption with wisdom and courage. Seek rebirth and revenge, but face tough moral choices. How far will you go?",
